sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Controller
    participant A as Adapter
    participant V as vLLM
    
    Note over C,V: Continue Reasoning
    C->>A: continue_reasoning=True<br/>prefix="For example,"
    A->>A: Pre-fill: "<step>## claim<br/>For example,"
    A->>A: Stop tokens: ["</step>"]
    A->>V: Generate continuation
    V-->>A: "studies show... </step>"
    A->>A: Parse reasoning fields
    A-->>C: {"claim": "For example, studies show..."}
    
    Note over C,V: Generate Final Answer
    C->>A: continue_reasoning=False
    A->>A: Pre-fill: "</thinking><answer>## argument"
    A->>A: Stop tokens: ["</answer>"]
    A->>V: Generate continuation
    V-->>A: "In conclusion... </answer>"
    A->>A: Parse output fields
    A-->>C: {"argument": "In conclusion..."}
